# Lin-Alg

This is a sub-library made specifically to be used in conjunction with stiff solvers present in the library.

Kindly read through the README document of the library.

This library is meant to support the use of the solvers in the linked library but can be utilized solo.


## Disclaimer

This project and the project aforementioned are not affliated or endorsed by Mathworks.
This is an independent open source project free to be used with attribution.


## Description

The library is based purely on C++ Standard Template to be used without any external dependencies.

The code repositories are part of a professional academic portfolio. Unauthorized use of code for training machine learning models or LLMs is strictly prohibited.